Z||000000||FieroPerformance||09-06-2001||02:55 PM||||My engine is out of the car and the block, heads and crank are at the machine shop. I had about 5 broken compression rings and 1 piston that looked like a dog was chewing on it. (the engine had 128,000 miles on it and was still running excellent but it was leaking oil from the main seal).<P>Anyway, I am having the block cleaned and bored, the crank ground to the next size, the connecting rods reconditioned and the heads reconditioned + a valve job. <P>Next the guy at the machine shop is going to find me some slightly higher compression domed pistons and a more agressive cam. I will be installing roller tip rockers also.<P>I have been taking pictures along the way and I will post them when it is done.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic.jpg"> ||||reg||1
